  id: vord_lance
  displayName: Vord Lance
  description: Endgame Hunter. Vord's perfected assassin. The Apostle's chosen.
  tier: 1
  family: 2
  behaviors:
  - "Engages, disengages, repositions \u2014 never stays in one spot more than 3
    seconds."
  - Counter-attacks specifically when player misses a swing.
  - "Has a 'final blow' attack at low HP that one-shots \u2014 must be dodged perfectly."
  - "Speaks to the player during the fight \u2014 old Kin language, half-lucid."
  abilities:
  - "Void Lance Thrust \u2014 high-precision pierce attack"
  - "Step-Echo \u2014 afterimages confuse player aim"
  - "Riposte Reading \u2014 counter on missed attacks"
  - "Final Verdict \u2014 endgame one-shot, telegraphed but hard to dodge"
  dropItemIds:
  - Void Lance (legendary weapon)
  - Vord-Chitin Plates (prestige armor)
  - Heart Fragment (1 of 7)
  - "Spirit Anchor (high-value \u2014 Lance was a beloved Kin commander)"
  boss_section: Hunter Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
